## API Endpoints Used

### API 01 — Register Member
```
POST {{base_url}}/auth/v1/signup
Headers:
  apikey: {{anon_key}}
  Content-Type: application/json
Body:
{
  "email": "newmember@example.com",
  "password": "StrongPassword123!",
  "data": {
    "first_name": "Juan",
    "last_name": "Dela Cruz"
  }
}
```
Expected behavior:
- Creates Supabase Auth account
- Database trigger creates public.users record with role = member
- App creates public.members record with QR token
- Generates a unique QR token
Expected status: 200 OK or successful Auth response

