## Navigation Flow
1. App starts at / (index.tsx) → redirects to /login
2. User can go to /signup or /forgot-password from login
3. After successful signup → redirects to /login
4. After successful login → redirects to role-specific dashboard:
   - Member → /member/dashboard
   - Admin → /admin/dashboard
   - Coach → /coach/dashboard
5. Each dashboard/profile screen checks auth and redirects to appropriate dashboard if role doesn't match
6. Logout from any dashboard → redirects to /login
7. Profile navigation:
   - Member: /member/dashboard → /member/profile → /member/edit-profile
   - Admin: /admin/dashboard → /admin/profile
   - Coach: /coach/dashboard → /coach/profile

