**Delete Member Fix (Nov 2026):**
- **Issue:** Delete button appeared to work but records remained in database
- **Root Cause:** RLS policies prevented deletion even for admin users
- **Solution:**
  1. Added `getServiceRoleClient()` in `src/lib/supabase.ts` to bypass RLS
  2. Updated delete function to use service role client instead of anon client
  3. Added service role key to `.env`: `EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY`
  4. Delete now removes from all tables (members, coaches, users) regardless of user role
  5. Added verification step to confirm deletion
- **Environment Variables Required:**
  ```
  EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
  EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIs...
